WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.838
This video shows how to read and manage your notifications on a phone.

00:00:06.502 --> 00:00:16.846
Tap the menu button and choose Notifications. The Inbox opens first, and new notifications are listed under Today, each with a coloured type label.

00:00:22.377 --> 00:00:28.689
Tap the All Types list and choose Fee due. Now only the fee reminders are listed.

00:00:34.268 --> 00:00:42.764
Switch the list back to All Types, then tick Unread only. Notifications you have already read disappear from the list.

00:00:50.754 --> 00:00:58.242
Tap Mark all read, then tap Confirm. A green message says all notifications are marked as read.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:26.226
Your inbox is up to date. You can also see the latest notifications from the bell at the top of any page.
